command /rules:
    trigger:
        send "&6===== SMP Rules ====="
        send "&a1. Respect all players."
        send "&a2. No griefing — destroying bases, stealing, or ruining the SMP is strictly forbidden."
        send "   &7(If both players agree, they can do anything on each other's property.)"
        send "&a3. No hacking, cheating, or exploiting bugs."
        send "&a4. Keep chat clean — no spamming or inappropriate content."
        send "&a5. Follow staff instructions at all times."
        send "&6====================="
